Lead regular code reviews to ensure consistent code quality;

Profile

+5 years of experience with Java software architecture and solution design, including Service-oriented architecture, Micro-service, event-driven architectures;

Proficient in developing back-end and front-end solutions for modern web applications using Java EE, Angular, JSF, and JavaScript;

DevOps processes and best practices;

HTML, XML, CSS, Javascript, Web services: REST, SOAP, Java EE, Javascript, Angular, JSF, JSP, Spring, Hibernate;

Database skills (RDBMS);

Fluent in English;

Experience in supervising outsourced ICT activities;

Agile and Prince2 development frameworks;

Micro-service frameworks (e.g. Spring Boot), Cloud technologies (AWS);

Location : Remote;

Communication and coordination of software architecture decisions with stakeholders in coordination with the ITZBund;
Coordination of the software architecture designs with the Client;
Advising the specialist department of the ITZBund as well as the design team on the detailing of technical requirements with regard to technical effort and complexity drivers;
Continuous improvement of the development architecture and processes;
Preparation and presentation of information and decision-making documents;
Organisation and assurance of the knowledge transfer to employees;

Expert knowledge in the role of architect in enterprise – projects;
Expert knowledge in particular of Java, Spring and Spring Boot Framework;
Expert knowledge of service-oriented architectures;
Expert knowledge of microservice architectures;
Expert knowledge of service composition and the orchestration of processes;
In-depth knowledge of relational databases;
In-depth knowledge of cloud technologies such as Kubernetes and OpenShift, or equivalent cloud technologies;
In-depth knowledge in the field of container virtualisation such as Docker or equivalent technologies;
Expert knowledge of complex projects with many individual components and their configuration;
Expert knowledge of dependency management such as Maven, NPM or equivalent technologies;
Expert knowledge of working with version control systems such as Git;
